"1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31923706", "author": {"steamid": "76561198242643980", "personaname": "RomanZZWQ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gaytards/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 61131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39275, "last_played": 1746139725, "avatar": "6bed2e9dfb40b89a973e6f2d86375616759d47e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "so, after 700+ hours i can certainly say that i know this game in and out. it is extremely fun to play and mess around in with friends, doesn't matter if your preference is milsim or arcade (think wasteland or koth) everyone will like this one way or another, you can fly walk drive swim, whatever suits your playstyle, and with a huge variety of mods in the workshop and huge freedom given by the devs you can compare this to an old nissan skyline, drives amazingly, is extremely customizable, sometimes breaks down on you. \nso, in conclusion, G R E A T G A M E, like, seriously this is great and i can recommend this to anyone who has the money, but don't forget to buy the dlc's or else multiplayer will be boring as the dlc's add a ♥♥♥♥ ton of content including maps, vehicles, missions, weapons, game mechanics, and much more \nso, just, get, it \n\n\n.Sledge", "timestamp_created": 1495569905, "timestamp_updated": 1495569905, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492307692766189575", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31920995", "author": {"steamid": "76561198179194362", "personaname": "InfectedLeftTesticle", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AcceptingAnul/", "num_games_owned": 249, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 57419, "playtime_las